WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.254
School attendance should be simple.

2
00:00:02.254 --> 00:00:04.539
But event lists, check-ins, and follow-ups?

3
00:00:04.539 --> 00:00:06.063
They can get messy.

4
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.635
Students want answers.

5
00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:11.349
Officers need clear records.

6
00:00:11.349 --> 00:00:13.492
Let's bring it all together.

7
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.336
Meet IARS!

8
00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:19.142
The Institution Attendance and Records System.

9
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:23.352
Attendance, events, and records, together for your school community.

10
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.208
Students open their current QR pass.

11
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.836
An authorized officer scans it, checks their identity, and records attendance.

12
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.061
Students review history.

13
00:00:38.061 --> 00:00:40.983
Officers filter records and download reports.

14
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.308
Clearer check-ins.

15
00:00:43.308 --> 00:00:44.265
Organized records.

16
00:00:44.265 --> 00:00:49.532
Easier follow-up on hours and excuse requests, within each assigned role.

17
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.589
Ready to bring your school records together?

18
00:00:54.589 --> 00:00:57.468
Explore IARS, and log in with your school account.
